# ~/.mbsyncrc — isync (mbsync) configuration for the alucard mail hub only.
#
# Replicas (Mac, dracula) never talk IMAP; they muchsync with alucard. Add another
# IMAPAccount/Store/Channel here for each future mailbox. The password comes from
# the sops-nix secret in modules/mail-credentials.nix; no secret in this file.

# ── Global defaults ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Create     Both
Expunge    Both
SyncState  *

IMAPAccount bereit
Host        mail.istbereit.de
Port        993
User        vincenzo@istbereit.de
PassCmd     "awk '/^machine mail[.]istbereit[.]de login vincenzo@istbereit[.]de password / {print $6; exit}' /run/secrets/mail/bereit_authinfo"
TLSType     IMAPS
TLSVersions +1.2 +1.3
AuthMechs   PLAIN

IMAPStore   bereit-remote
Account     bereit

MaildirStore bereit-local
Subfolders   Verbatim
Path         ~/Maildir/bereit/
Inbox        ~/Maildir/bereit/INBOX

Channel     bereit
Far         :bereit-remote:
Near        :bereit-local:
Patterns    *
